      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "ArrayList<Integer> arr = new ArrayList<Integer>();\r\nint size = 20;\r\n\r\nfor (int i = 0; i < 30; i++) {\r\n    if(size == i){\r\n        break;\r\n    }else{\r\n        arr.add(i);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nSystem.out.println(arr);\r\nSystem.out.println(\"The size of the array list is : \"+arr.size());\r\n\r\n",
